# Gameplay constitution

Follow `GAME_SPEC.md` for order and scope. Follow `DESIGN.md` / `ART_GUIDE.md` for feel.

- Pitch: keep the concert from stopping. This is not a rhythm game.
- MVP: 1 school-festival stage, 1 song, 1 player first, 4 accidents, ~3 minutes
- Do not add accidents 2–4 until cable (Phase 7) is confirmed
- Audience tension is HP. Accidents are visual, never warning text
- Co-op, chaos chains, extra maps are Phase 17+
